<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The small flag in front of a nickname is the language that person uses the chat in. You see it in the conversation, in the user list, in private messages, on the card somebody sees when they look you up, and above people in a virtual space."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_globe}>{dgettext("help_features", "Changing Yours")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Your flag is the language you pick under Start ▸ Language. Pick another one and the chat reopens in it, and everybody else's user list shows your new flag."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_warning}>{dgettext("help_features", "Who Has One")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Everybody, visitors included. Somebody whose own language the chat does not offer reads it in English, so their flag is the English one."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_channel}>{dgettext("help_features", "A Channel's Language")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A channel can have a flag too: the language people speak there, beside the channel's name in its tab, in the conversations list, in the channel list, above the conversation and in its public archive. Its founder chooses it with /cs language followed by a code such as pt_BR, or under Channel Central ▸ Registration ▸ Language, and /cs language none takes it away."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A channel whose founder has not chosen one has no flag. The Retro Games channels are English."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_bot_management}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "A Bot's Language")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Bots carry a flag too, for the language they speak. An admin gives one with /bot set followed by the bot's name, language and a code such as pt_BR, or in Bot Management. A bot nobody gave a language has no flag; GameServ, in the Retro Games channels, is English."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-character-portraits">
    {dgettext("help", "Character Portraits")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="ui-start-menu">
    {dgettext("help", "The Start Menu")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-cs">{dgettext("help", "/cs")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="bot-command">{dgettext("help", "/bot")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="chanserv-ui">
    {dgettext("help", "ChanServ in Channel Central")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
